{"id":"steam-845230","steam":845230,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Super Cubiform","summary":"As a Guildship Captain you must rely on your wits and a computer repair program to survive! Super Cubiform is a sandwich of genres, \r\nArena Action Platformer + First Person Adventure! Enjoy arena-based platforming action as the Cubiform, and an urgent mystery as the Guildship Captain...","about":"In the depths of space, you must rely on your wits and your reflexes, using the digital repair program Super Cubiform to restore functionality to your ship's systems, recover log data, and uncover the mystery behind the robot that brought you all the way out here! Switch between exploring and repairing your ship as its Captain, and collecting data and busting viral operators as the Super Cubiform in this mashup of genres!\r\n\r\nSuper Cubiform is an \"Arena Action Platformer\", which combines the fast pace and precision of games like Quake with retro platforming abilities! Race against the timer as you recollect data fragments and remove Viral Ops from the level, clearing it as quickly as you can! \r\n\r\nWhen you progress in recovering data, ship systems, locations, and logs become available to you as the Captain, allowing you to get closer to recovering your ship and solving the mystery of the mysterious droid that you've recovered on an expedition...\r\n\r\n\nkey Features\n\n\r\n•  No level loading in singleplayer, simply open the level from your in-universe PC\r\n•  Discover the story behind your current predicament through data recovery, exploaration, and puzzle solving\r\n•  Cubiform movement and combat is one in the same; chain together abilities to platform and destroy enemies in one motion\r\n•  Competitive online arena Multiplayer; face off against other players to determine the most mathematically superior Cubiform!\r\n•  Wave mode that becomes increasingly difficult, play alone or with a friend!\r\n•  Level editor allowing you to craft your own levels and modes, w